  "articleContent": "<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Z5eadiwdPoJcOBxkcEwcNJ7Pnl9\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Z5eadiwdPoJcOBxkcEwcNJ7Pnl9\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Z5eadiwdPoJcOBxkcEwcNJ7Pnl9\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Dear Rovers, To deliver a higher-quality gaming experience across a wide range of device specifications, the \"Tiered Client Resource Downloads\" feature is scheduled to be launched soon on Wuthering Waves, initially as a limited test. This feature allows you to select and download game resources of your preferred graphics quality based on the storage space and specifications of your device. With this feature, you can reduce storage space usage while maintaining satisfactory graphics quality.</span></p>\n<p><br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\">Feature Overview</span></strong><br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">What is Tiered Client Resource Downloads?</span></strong><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Tiered Client Resource Downloads is a feature that allows you to select between different resource tiers. In future versions of Wuthering Waves, the original single resource package will be divided into three tiers based on differences in graphics quality, models, and other game assets: UHD, HD, and SD. You may select and download the tier that best suits the storage space and specifications of your device.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">This feature is designed to allow you to choose better graphics quality or lower storage space usage based on your actual gaming needs, thereby providing a better gaming experience.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Tier Specifications</span></strong><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Tiered Client Resource Downloads will be available for the PC, iOS, and Android versions of the game. The package tiers vary in in-game graphics quality, video bitrate, and other game assets. Supported platforms and tiers are outlined below:</span></p>\n<div data-page-id=\"Z5eadiwdPoJcOBxkcEwcNJ7Pnl9\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<table style=\"border: medium; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; width: 1103px; height: 240px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"142;361;317\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 202.333px;\" width=\"142\"><col style=\"width: 478.333px;\" width=\"361\"><col style=\"width: 423.333px;\" width=\"317\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px; text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Platform</strong></span></div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Available Tiers</strong></span></div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Maximum Number of Local Packages</strong></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px; text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">PC</span></div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">UHD/HD/SD</span></div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Up to 3 packages (tiers) installed locally</span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">iOS/Android</span></div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">HD/SD</span></div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Up to 1 package (tier) installed locally</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">※Due to platform restrictions, platforms not listed above currently do not support resource tiering. Once this feature goes live, the HD package will be downloaded by default on those platforms.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">※Due to hardware limitations, only the SD package is available on certain mobile devices, in order to ensure a stable, smooth gaming experience. Please refer to your actual in-game experience.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Package Downloading &amp; Switching</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">PC：</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download your desired tier or tiers directly from the launcher. You can install up to 3 different tiers locally and switch between them any time. If you have multiple tiers installed, to run the game, simply choose one tier from the launcher to launch (only one can run at a time). If you need to uninstall a specific tier, select the corresponding package before uninstalling.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/akiwebsite/website2.0/images/1790179200000/ra44knce3qj436ld16-1790244779956.jpeg\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">iOS / Android:</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Select your desired package tier from the in-game \"Download Resources\" menu. Once the download is complete, you can redownload and switch to another tier via Settings &gt; Graphics &gt; Resource Quality.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">※On mobile devices, every switch between packages requires downloading the difference between the HD and SD packages.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/akiwebsite/website2.0/images/1790179200000/f48jecwi96jekqev2d-1790244779832.jpeg\" width=\"1300\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\"></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/akiwebsite/website2.0/images/1790179200000/3mwlvzyis9as4kmihz-1790244779922.jpeg\" width=\"1300\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\"></span><br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">Test Schedule</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Test Participants and Test Schedule</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">PC (※Official Launcher): The test will become gradually available on PC after the Version 3.7 update.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">iOS/Android Mobile: The test will become available on all iOS/Android mobile devices after the Version 3.7 update.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Notes</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">We will soon (during Version 3.6) make a PC launcher update available to some of the Rovers who are granted access to the limited test. However, the \"Tiered Client Resource Downloads\" feature will only go live after the Version 3.7 update. During Version 3.6, being granted access to the limited test will not affect your current gaming experience.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Following the Version 3.7 update, PC users who have not been granted access to the limited test will have their resource package updated to the High-Definition (HD) version by default. Once you enter the test, you can adjust the resource tier based on your needs.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">※The feature will also be gradually made available on PC platforms with non-official launchers after the test concludes. Please stay tuned for future announcements.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\">Notes &amp; Reminders</span></strong><br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">About Version 3.7 Pre-download</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">PC (※Official Launcher):</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For Rovers who are granted access to the limited test and update the official launcher during Version 3.6, Version 3.7 pre-download will be temporarily unavailable due to cross-version functionality differences. You may select and download a suitable resource tier after the Version 3.7 update.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For Rovers who do not gain access to the limited test during Version 3.6, pre-download will remain available, and if they use the pre-download feature, the HD resource tier will be downloaded by default. After gaining test access in Version 3.7, you can then choose a resource tier based on your needs.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">iOS/Android Mobile:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"number\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Once Version 3.7 pre-download becomes available, only a portion of the resources will be pre-downloaded on iOS and Android mobile devices. The remaining tiered resources will be downloaded separately after the Version 3.7 update, based on the package selected.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">※The Pre-download feature from Version 3.7 onward will function as usual, and the pre-downloaded resources will be of the same tier as your currently selected resources.</span></p>\n<p><br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">How to Choose a Package Tier</span></strong><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">After the Version 3.7 update, if you have been included in the limited test, the recommended package will be marked on your device based on the device specifications. Alternatively, you can refer to the following specs table to select the right package.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div data-page-id=\"Z5eadiwdPoJcOBxkcEwcNJ7Pnl9\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<ul style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">PC</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<table style=\"border: medium; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; width: 1169px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 316px;\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"259;242;180;227;206\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 264.4px;\" width=\"259\"><col style=\"width: 247.4px;\" width=\"242\"><col style=\"width: 185.4px;\" width=\"180\"><col style=\"width: 232.4px;\" width=\"227\"><col style=\"width: 211.4px;\" width=\"206\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px; text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>CPU</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>GPU</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220,155,4);\"><strong>Recommended </strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(220,155,4);\"><strong>RAM</strong></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Recommended Resolution</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Recommended Package</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px; text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Intel i7-12700/AMD R7 7700</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">RTX4080/RX 7900 XT</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">32G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">3840X2160</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">UHD</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px; text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Intel i7-9700/AMD R7 3700X</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">RTX3060/RX6700XT/Arc B580</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">32G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2560X1440</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">HD</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Intel i5-9400/AMD R7 2700</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">GTX 1060/RX 570/Arc A380</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">16G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1920X1080</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">SD</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div data-page-id=\"Z5eadiwdPoJcOBxkcEwcNJ7Pnl9\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<ul style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">iOS</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<table style=\"border: medium; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; width: 1159px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 248px;\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"259;154;100;234\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 379.25px;\" width=\"259\"><col style=\"width: 249.25px;\" width=\"154\"><col style=\"width: 183.25px;\" width=\"100\"><col style=\"width: 348.25px;\" width=\"234\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px; text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Model</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Chip</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>RAM</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Recommended Package</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px; text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">iPhone14/iPad mini (6th generation)</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A15</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">6G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">HD</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">iPhone11/iPad (9th generation)</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A13</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">4G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">SD</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Z5eadiwdPoJcOBxkcEwcNJ7Pnl9\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<ul style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Android</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<table style=\"border: medium; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; width: 1146px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 262px;\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"367;154;226\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 522px;\" width=\"367\"><col style=\"width: 265px;\" width=\"154\"><col style=\"width: 352px;\" width=\"226\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px; text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Chipset</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>RAM</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Recommended Package</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px; text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Snapdragon 8 Gen1/MediaTek Dimensity 9000/Kirin 9010/Exynos 2200</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">8G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">HD</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Snapdragon 855/MediaTek Dimensity 1000/Kirin 980/Exynos 9820</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">6G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">SD</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">About In-Game Resource Adjustments</span></strong></div>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Graphics Resource Adjustments</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">After the release of the \"Tiered Client Resource Downloads\" feature, the Ultra Quality option in the in-game Graphics Quality settings will be available only in the UHD package. Therefore, after Version 3.7 goes live, if you are not in the limited test, you will temporarily be unable to enable the Ultra Graphics option on PC. To enable this option, you need to download the UHD package first after entering the test.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Video Resource Adjustments</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">After the release of the \"Tiered Client Resource Downloads\" feature, bitrates of certain cutscenes and other video assets will be adjusted accordingly; consequently, visual fidelity may differ between packages.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Following the Version 3.7 update, because PC users who have not been granted access to the limited test will download the HD package by default, the visual performance of certain video resources may be somewhat different from the previous versions. When you are granted test access, you can download the UHD package for higher bitrates.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Future Resource Adjustments</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The upcoming \"Tiered Client Resource Downloads\" feature is currently under continuous optimization. In the future, we may adjust the resources included in each tier based on in-game performance and player feedback. The adjusted resources may differ slightly from those in the current test version. Announcements about adjustments in this regard will be made during the corresponding versions. Please stay tuned.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\">About Release Schedule on PC Platforms Using Non-official Launchers</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14pt;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Steam</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">To bring the \"Tiered Client Resource Downloads\" feature to Steam, we plan to release the official launcher on this platform in the future. When the Official Launcher becomes available on Steam, the platform will also support pre-download for the game. Please remember to update your launcher and experience the new features. These features are currently under active development and will be made available as soon as possible. We will notify you of the release schedule and detailed instructions on how to update the launcher in future announcements. Please stay tuned.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\">FAQ</span></strong><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Q: Are package tiers the same as in-game graphics settings?</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A: No, they are different. The package tier determines the upper limit of the quality of the downloaded resources, such as image clarity and video bitrate, while in-game graphics settings remain adjustable. However, visual performance and resolution will vary from tier to tier even with the same graphics settings. For example, with the High Quality option enabled, the UHD package delivers higher image clarity and shows more details than the HD package.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Q: What are the differences between the various package tiers?</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A: The package tiers vary in package size, video bitrate, and highest available resolution. For instance, the differences between the available tiers in Version 3.7 are as follows:</span><br><br></p>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Z5eadiwdPoJcOBxkcEwcNJ7Pnl9\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<table style=\"border: medium; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; width: 1276px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; height: 445px;\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"138;152;244;257;233;287\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 135px;\" width=\"138\"><col style=\"width: 149px;\" width=\"152\"><col style=\"width: 241px;\" width=\"244\"><col style=\"width: 254px;\" width=\"257\"><col style=\"width: 230px;\" width=\"233\"><col style=\"width: 284px;\" width=\"287\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px; text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Platform</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Package Tier</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Size (excluding cutscenes)</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Size (including cutscenes)</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Recommended Resolution</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(220, 155, 4); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Highest Available Graphics Quality</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px; text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"3\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">PC</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">UHD</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">99G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">128G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">3840X2160</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Ultra Quality</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px; text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">HD</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">80G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">97G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2560X1440</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">High Quality</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px; text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">SD</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">58G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">70G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1920X1080</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Balanced</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px; text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">iOS / Android</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">HD</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">40G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">53G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">/</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">High Quality</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 39px;\">\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">SD</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">35G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">43G</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">/</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); font-size: 10pt; padding: 8px; vertical-align: middle;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Balanced</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<table data-ace-table-col-widths=\"138;152;244;257;233;287\"><colgroup><col width=\"138\"></colgroup></table>\n<br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">※Package sizes shown are estimates. Please refer to the actual sizes in Version 3.7.</span><br><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Q: How do I know which package to choose?</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A: If you have been included in the limited test, the recommended package will be marked on your device based on the device specifications. Alternatively, you can refer to the specs table listed in the \"How to Choose a Package Tier\" section.</span><br><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Q: Can I download a tier higher than what is recommended?</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A: Yes. The recommendation is made based on your device specifications. You are free to download any tier you prefer. However, downloading a tier higher than recommended will take up unnecessary storage space and could cause framerate fluctuations, device overheating, and other issues. Please adjust accordingly based on your experience.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">※Due to hardware limitations, only the SD package is available on certain iOS/Android devices, in order to ensure a stable, smooth gaming experience.</span><br><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Q: How many packages can I install locally?</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A: Up to 3 different package tiers can be installed locally at the same time on PC; there is no need to uninstall existing tiers before downloading new ones. Only 1 package tier can be installed locally at the same time on mobile devices, and every switch between packages requires downloading the difference between the packages.</span><br><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Q: If I'm in the limited test, can I exit it and pre-download Version 3.7?</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A: Unfortunately, once you enter the test during Version 3.6, you cannot exit it. You may select and download a suitable resource tier after the Version 3.7 update. Thank you for your support and understanding.</span><br><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Q: Will my access to the pre-download option be affected if I'm not in the limited test?</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A: No. If you're not in the limited test, you can pre-download as normal, but the HD package will be pre-downloaded by default. For more details, please refer to the \"About Version 3.7 Pre-download\" section above.</span><br><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Q: Can I participate in the test if I'm not using the official launcher on PC?</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A: The test is currently available only on PC devices using the official launcher. Access to this feature will be gradually opened to other PC platforms with non-official launchers once the test concludes. For details, please refer to the \"About Release Schedule on PC Platforms Using Non-official Launchers\" section.</span><br><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Q: Will the resources of each tier change in the future?</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A: The upcoming \"Tiered Client Resource Downloads\" feature is currently under continuous optimization. In the future, we may adjust the resources included in each tier based on in-game performance and player feedback. The adjusted resources may differ to some extent from those in the current test version. Announcements about adjustments in this regard will be made during the corresponding versions. Please stay tuned.</span><br><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">We will continue to refine the \"Tiered Client Resource Downloads\" feature based on player feedback. If you encounter any issues or have any suggestions, please access the in-game [Feedback] feature to submit your feedback. Thank you for your support and understanding.</span></div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Z5eadiwdPoJcOBxkcEwcNJ7Pnl9\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\" data-page-id=\"Z5eadiwdPoJcOBxkcEwcNJ7Pnl9\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Wuthering Waves Dev Team</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
